  "gaps": [
    "Gate areaHint values are historical S03 station-frame easting and northing for search context. Every 3D gate threshold, its paid/public offsets and its ties to public concourse nodes await placement.",
    "Platform centerlines, track orientation and spacing, width and length measurements, and rail elevations lack a qualified station-frame tie. Widths, lengths, and z_m are preview values. Width is for the entire physical deck.",
    "Actual paid passage geometry and the main-line gate-to-device assignments are open. For S01, the Toei guide gives the gate associations and the CSV gives equipment classes. Representative links summarize the gate-to-deck routes, with B4F where the transfer is supported or planned.",
    "S03 has two 京王新線口 gate features and Toei names one gate. The unplaced POI remains an evidence record until both physical identities can be checked. The adjacent E27 gate identities also need a tie. Exit 2 is a closed public exit. The other unassigned Toei exit POIs do not identify fare gates.",
    "S03 v5_nav remains on hold for routing. PLATEAU 13104 has no established Keio public/paid feature tie here. MLIT R2 is login-gated and was skipped.",
    "Toei's accessibility PDF yielded a challenge to default curl. Toei's indexed PDF supplied the readable S01 row. Exact construction detours, device availability, gate hours, and present opening status remain open."
